{"full":"hf:FINAL-Bench/Decision-AI-Web","spaceId":"FINAL-Bench/Decision-AI-Web","name":"Decide Live","source":"huggingface","description":"On-device decisions from camera and microphone","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","topics":["static","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":38,"created":"2026-10-09T18:33:56.000Z","updated":"2026-10-12T03:28:29.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://final-bench-decision-ai-web.static.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/FINAL-Bench/Decision-AI-Web","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:28:21.520Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T13:28:21.520Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T13:28:21.520Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🎯","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A static page that makes zero-token decisions in the browser. A multimodal embedding model, EmbeddingGemma 2 (Apache-2.0) fine-tuned for decisions, runs locally with transformers.js 4.3.1 on WebGPU, or on the CPU (WASM) when WebGPU is not available (much slower).","The ONNX files (from the private model repo FINAL-Bench/EmbeddingGemma2-ZTC-ONNX, same file layout as onnx-community/embeddinggemma-2-ONNX) are served from this Space under models/egemma2-decide/, so the page needs no access to any other repository. There is no server and no API call per decision. The weights are downloaded once and cached by the browser. Camera frames, microphone audio, images and text are processed on the device and are never uploaded."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/FINAL-Bench/Decision-AI-Web/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"336abfbf6e6e54649a2a2f82d13e84d66f7fb8d195a2c14fbd0f3990695c289d","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T04:02:36.074Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:28:21.555Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A static page that makes zero-token decisions in the browser. A multimodal embedding model, EmbeddingGemma 2 (Apache-2.0) fine-tuned f